Hello <%= @resource.email %>!

Someone has requested a link to change your password. Open this URL in your browser:

<% origin = ENV.fetch("CLIENT_ORIGIN", "http://localhost:3002").chomp("/") %>
<%= "#{origin}/reset-password?reset_password_token=#{CGI.escape(@token)}" %>

If you didn't request this, please ignore this email.
Your password won't change until you use the link above.
